      ":question/problem": "Find the value of ${x}_{2}+{x}_{3}$ given that $3a-5x=b$ and\n\n$$\na=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,x=\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}12 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 17\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
